WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 47= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:43.310 --> 01:44.230
Come catch me!

8
01:45.040 --> 01:45.920
Be careful.

9
01:46.904 --> 01:49.120
- It's Chinese New Year! - It's Chinese New Year!

10
01:55.200 --> 01:56.760
Zhangrun, come catch me!

11
01:58.840 --> 02:00.350
The fireworks are so beautiful!

12
02:06.350 --> 02:07.200
See? If I do this,

13
02:07.200 --> 02:08.870
you can't catch me!

14
02:13.560 --> 02:14.630
Mother.

15
02:18.190 --> 02:20.000
Mother, I miss Father.

16
02:20.080 --> 02:21.880
The bad men have all been driven away.

17
02:21.896 --> 02:23.960
Why isn't Father back yet?

18
02:26.150 --> 02:27.710
My birthday is just over

19
02:27.870 --> 02:29.430
two months away.

20
02:29.624 --> 02:31.030
Father will surely be back by then

21
02:31.030 --> 02:32.750
to celebrate my birthday with me, right?

22
02:36.710 --> 02:38.710
Your father misses you both very much too.

23
02:39.128 --> 02:41.030
I'm sure he'll come back as soon as he can.

24
02:47.710 --> 02:48.960
On this Chinese New Year's Eve,

25
02:49.430 --> 02:50.470
your father won't be here,

26
02:51.150 --> 02:53.590
so you must stay up with me to welcome the Chinese New Year.

27
02:54.310 --> 02:56.590
Later, we'll play Toss for Fortune.

28
02:56.632 --> 02:59.030
When the time comes, we all have to put our strength into it

29
02:59.240 --> 03:01.000
so we'll gain a fortune

30
03:01.120 --> 03:02.360
and become rich.

31
03:02.840 --> 03:03.910
I want to Toss for Fortune!

32
03:03.910 --> 03:05.240
I want to get rich!

33
03:05.360 --> 03:06.520
I want to get rich, too!

34
03:07.710 --> 03:08.240
Come on.

35
03:12.240 --> 03:13.430
When the fifth watch comes,

36
03:13.960 --> 03:15.030
we'll take that

37
03:15.030 --> 03:16.630
door bolt tied with red silk

38
03:16.750 --> 03:18.240
and toss it high into the air.

39
03:18.360 --> 03:19.280
And we have to shout,

40
03:19.520 --> 03:21.870
"Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"

41
03:21.960 --> 03:24.710
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!" - "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"

42
03:24.808 --> 03:27.520
- "May big ingots roll right in!" - "May big ingots roll right in!"

43
03:27.592 --> 03:31.750
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!" - "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

44
03:32.430 --> 03:34.710
- "Let the cats come, let the dogs come!" - "Let the cats come, let the dogs come!"

45
03:34.800 --> 03:37.560
- "May the God of Wealth come to our home!" - "May the God of Wealth come to our home!"

46
03:37.624 --> 03:40.250
- "May big ingots roll right in!" - "May big ingots roll right in!"

47
03:40.310 --> 03:43.430
- I'll toss mine the highest and get the richest! - "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

48
03:43.630 --> 03:44.960
I'm taller than you.

49
03:44.960 --> 03:46.000
- And stronger than you! - "Big ingots,"

50
03:46.000 --> 03:47.280
- I'll be the richest! - "roll right in!"

51
03:47.368 --> 03:51.672
- "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!" - "May little ingots squeeze in through the cracks!"

52
04:07.680 --> 04:08.750
It's snowing.

53
04:09.570 --> 04:12.430
It's snowing!

54
04:12.470 --> 04:14.310
A timely snow promises a bountiful year.

55
04:14.840 --> 04:17.390
May the harvest be plentiful and bring us great fortune!

56
04:17.480 --> 04:20.040
May the harvest be plentiful and bring us great fortune!

57
05:32.220 --> 05:36.900
(Emperor, formerly the Retired Emperor)

58
05:40.630 --> 05:41.800
It's already the Hour of Zi.

59
05:42.160 --> 05:43.830
Your Majesty, you should get some rest.

60
05:47.560 --> 05:48.430
Han Liang

61
05:49.040 --> 05:50.600
is still outside the Imperial Study?

62
05:51.250 --> 05:53.128
(Fourth-Rank Eunuch of the Directorate of Imperial Regalia)

63
05:53.140 --> 05:54.820
Your Majesty hasn't allowed him to leave,

64
05:54.830 --> 05:56.248
so naturally he doesn't dare leave.

65
05:56.430 --> 05:57.070
Back when

66
05:57.080 --> 05:59.160
Your Majesty had only just fallen into Wona's hands,

67
05:59.270 --> 06:00.870
Han Liang was already in a great hurry

68
06:00.968 --> 06:02.648
to urge the enthronement of a new emperor.

69
06:03.120 --> 06:05.360
That alone shows his disloyalty to Your Majesty.

70
06:06.600 --> 06:08.600
Now, after overcoming every obstacle,

71
06:08.610 --> 06:10.120
Your Majesty has regained the throne,

72
06:10.310 --> 06:11.680
yet Han Liang remains unrepentant

73
06:11.784 --> 06:13.180
and instead criticizes Your Majesty

74
06:13.190 --> 06:14.552
for placing your trust in eunuchs like us,

75
06:14.584 --> 06:16.120
who are utterly loyal to Your Majesty

76
06:16.136 --> 06:17.592
and would follow you even unto death.

77
06:18.480 --> 06:20.040
Your Majesty is far too merciful.

78
06:20.600 --> 06:22.390
You should make an example of him

79
06:22.600 --> 06:23.830
as a warning to others.

80
06:35.680 --> 06:36.720
Get some rest.

81
06:58.400 --> 07:05.170
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

82
07:05.950 --> 07:13.340
♪The encounters of half a lifetime are kept within this little world♪

83
07:13.500 --> 07:20.400
♪Bit by bit, the passing years become the preface♪

84
07:20.950 --> 07:23.380
♪The joys and sorrows of the past♪

85
07:23.380 --> 07:28.930
♪Quietly dwell here♪

86
07:29.300 --> 07:33.480
♪With my own hands and heart♪

87
07:33.480 --> 07:36.980
♪I write my name♪

88
07:37.360 --> 07:40.730
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

89
07:40.980 --> 07:44.230
♪Step by step toward the light♪

90
07:44.310 --> 07:48.540
♪With what I know and what I do♪

91
07:48.540 --> 07:51.740
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

92
07:51.740 --> 07:54.220
♪The long night is almost over♪

93
07:54.220 --> 08:02.380
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

94
08:24.190 --> 08:25.120
Who would dare

95
08:25.144 --> 08:26.856
build a snowman outside the Imperial Study?

96
08:26.904 --> 08:28.000
Do they have a death wish?

97
08:30.390 --> 08:31.720
That's not a snowman.

98
08:57.150 --> 08:57.750
He's dead.

99
09:42.500 --> 09:54.540
♪Let's begin with the Zuo Commentary on the Spring and Autumn Annals♪

100
09:54.840 --> 10:01.500
♪The late Emperor's successors rose and shaped the realm♪

101
10:01.760 --> 10:13.080
♪How many emperors were wise, and how many were foolish?♪

102
10:41.300 --> 10:44.460
(Six Months Later)

103
10:47.500 --> 10:52.940
(True Joy)

104
10:52.960 --> 10:53.840
I heard

105
10:54.030 --> 10:55.600
it wasn't just Minister Han who died.

106
10:56.670 --> 10:58.440
Several officials who followed Minister Han

107
10:58.440 --> 11:00.136
in supporting the new emperor back then

108
11:00.440 --> 11:02.630
were also framed by Eunuch Cao on various charges.

109
11:04.270 --> 11:05.550
Some were dismissed,

110
11:06.150 --> 11:07.600
while others were imprisoned.

111
11:12.630 --> 11:13.960
The emperor keeps changing.

112
11:15.120 --> 11:16.000
The capital

113
11:16.630 --> 11:17.670
is truly in chaos.

114
11:18.200 --> 11:19.790
Back then, I was so enthusiastic

115
11:20.150 --> 11:21.600
about urging Lanxiang and Suhua

116
11:21.600 --> 11:23.720
to buy land and houses in the capital.

117
11:24.360 --> 11:26.270
Thankfully, Lanxiang had better judgment.

118
11:26.312 --> 11:28.230
Not only did she refrain from buying any herself,

119
11:28.248 --> 11:30.140
but she also persuaded us to abandon the idea.

120
11:30.150 --> 11:31.750
We just happened to avoid it.

121
11:38.360 --> 11:39.550
It's already June.

122
11:40.720 --> 11:42.120
As long as Jinqi isn't back,

123
11:42.630 --> 11:43.480
I can't

124
11:43.790 --> 11:44.910
rest easy.

125
11:48.790 --> 11:49.630
Aunt Lanxiang!

126
11:50.720 --> 11:51.510
Aunt Lanxiang!

127
11:56.500 --> 12:00.020
(Lin Zhangjun, 24 years old) Uncle Jinqi is back.

128
12:03.688 --> 12:05.390
His Lordship has reached the wharf?

129
12:07.120 --> 12:07.870
Uncle Jinqi

130
12:08.008 --> 12:09.440
has already reached the side gate.

131
12:17.260 --> 12:19.840
♪The golden sunset♪

132
12:19.840 --> 12:22.940
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

133
12:26.440 --> 12:28.360
Look. Does this have three heads and six arms?

134
12:28.510 --> 12:29.910
One, two, three?

135
12:30.840 --> 12:32.550
Father, this sword is so heavy,

136
12:32.910 --> 12:34.000
but I like it.

137
12:34.960 --> 12:36.080
Slow down, Zhangcheng.

138
12:37.544 --> 12:38.910
Didn't you miss your father?

139
12:39.220 --> 12:44.660
♪I wonder if the past has ever been heard♪

140
12:47.640 --> 12:50.800
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

141
12:52.840 --> 12:53.150
Look.

142
12:54.360 --> 12:55.390
Mother is back.

143
12:57.320 --> 12:58.360
Mother, hurry!

144
13:01.560 --> 13:05.020
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

145
13:05.420 --> 13:08.790
♪If the reflection isn't real, what does it matter?♪

146
13:09.490 --> 13:14.580
♪I still remember your name♪

147
13:16.770 --> 13:19.360
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

148
13:19.360 --> 13:23.880
♪For withholding its light♪

149
13:26.120 --> 13:28.120
Mother, Father gave me this sword.

150
13:28.264 --> 13:30.072
He's going to teach me swordsmanship, too.

151
13:30.910 --> 13:31.750
Be careful.

152
13:31.750 --> 13:32.790
Don't hurt anyone.

153
13:32.910 --> 13:33.320
All right.

154
13:33.384 --> 13:34.850
The blade hasn't been sharpened yet.

155
13:34.920 --> 13:36.720
Once Zhangcheng has mastered swordsmanship,

156
13:37.030 --> 13:38.200
we'll have it sharpened.

157
13:40.104 --> 13:41.960
You've had a long journey, Your Lordship.

158
13:45.390 --> 13:46.720
Go play with your sister.

159
13:47.200 --> 13:49.200
I want to play with Father.

160
13:53.816 --> 13:56.360
Father and Mother haven't seen each other for over half a year.

161
13:56.390 --> 13:58.320
Why are you getting in the way? Come with me.

162
13:59.000 --> 14:00.030
Father, Mother.

163
14:00.030 --> 14:00.440
Come on.

164
14:01.144 --> 14:02.728
I'll take you to play by the pond.

165
14:09.160 --> 14:12.310
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

166
14:12.310 --> 14:15.600
♪Lightly trace the cause and effect♪

167
14:16.740 --> 14:19.350
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

168
14:19.350 --> 14:22.560
♪Returns to this moment♪

169
14:23.100 --> 14:26.240
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

170
14:26.600 --> 14:27.630
I'm home.

171
14:31.320 --> 14:32.870
I've waited so long for you.

172
14:38.220 --> 14:40.760
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

173
14:40.760 --> 14:45.220
♪For withholding its light♪

174
14:45.780 --> 14:49.330
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

175
14:49.330 --> 14:53.130
♪Still live and thrive♪

176
14:53.380 --> 14:56.720
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

177
14:56.880 --> 15:00.090
♪Leaving them buried deep within the years♪

178
15:08.320 --> 15:09.240
Originally,

179
15:09.272 --> 15:11.288
I could've made it home for the Chinese New Year.

180
15:12.910 --> 15:14.270
But at the time, we had to welcome

181
15:16.120 --> 15:17.200
His Majesty back,

182
15:19.240 --> 15:21.240
so I couldn't just leave.

183
15:21.720 --> 15:23.030
It would've seemed disrespectful.

184
15:24.720 --> 15:26.150
Later, I thought

185
15:27.240 --> 15:28.390
I could make it back

186
15:28.870 --> 15:30.550
for Zhangcheng's birthday.

187
15:31.630 --> 15:34.360
But then His Majesty reclaimed the throne.

188
15:36.960 --> 15:39.200
I decided I had to leave no matter what.

189
15:40.720 --> 15:41.670
But then

190
15:43.240 --> 15:44.910
something happened to Minister Han.

191
15:48.440 --> 15:50.240
The Han family has few relatives.

192
15:51.030 --> 15:52.960
Madam Han was left alone with her children.

193
15:55.000 --> 15:56.360
Minister Han and I

194
15:56.870 --> 15:59.030
were both disciples of Scholar Shouyi.

195
16:00.150 --> 16:01.790
I couldn't simply look the other way.

196
16:03.030 --> 16:04.480
So I made up my mind

197
16:05.270 --> 16:06.670
to escort Madam Han

198
16:07.120 --> 16:10.030
and Minister Han's coffin back to Suzhou.

199
16:10.790 --> 16:12.910
We laid Minister Han to rest in his ancestral grave.

200
16:14.344 --> 16:16.390
By the time the funeral arrangements were complete,

201
16:17.360 --> 16:18.870
it was already this late.

202
16:24.840 --> 16:26.910
Will Madam Han and the children

203
16:27.080 --> 16:28.240
return to the capital?

204
16:29.440 --> 16:31.150
Madam Han is strong-willed.

205
16:32.030 --> 16:33.510
If she stays in the capital,

206
16:34.200 --> 16:35.030
I'm afraid

207
16:35.320 --> 16:37.870
she'll clash with those eunuchs sooner or later.

208
16:39.910 --> 16:42.670
At the urging of her sister and brother-in-law,

209
16:43.910 --> 16:46.000
Madam Han settled in Jinling.

210
16:47.240 --> 16:48.630
She now lives in

211
16:49.000 --> 16:51.670
Minister Han's former residence on Wenchang Street.

212
16:53.630 --> 16:55.000
Back when Madam Han

213
16:55.200 --> 16:56.550
was still Young Lady Dong,

214
16:56.790 --> 16:58.270
she killed Dai Rui with her own hands

215
16:58.480 --> 16:59.630
and avenged her father.

216
17:00.240 --> 17:02.510
If she didn't have children now,

217
17:03.720 --> 17:05.590
I'm afraid she'd risk her own life

218
17:06.200 --> 17:07.680
to kill Eunuch Cao.

219
17:10.790 --> 17:12.000
Scholar Shouyi

220
17:12.680 --> 17:14.550
had already retired to his home,

221
17:15.830 --> 17:18.510
but when he heard that his prized disciple had died unjustly,

222
17:19.440 --> 17:20.720
he was so shaken

223
17:21.510 --> 17:24.270
that he had his grandson carry him from place to place,

224
17:25.240 --> 17:28.640
rallying renowned scholars throughout Jiangnan

225
17:29.400 --> 17:31.350
to submit a memorial to His Majesty.

226
17:34.070 --> 17:35.870
It said that the founding Emperor

227
17:36.270 --> 17:38.550
had wrongfully condemned Grand Secretary Shen and his sons

228
17:40.110 --> 17:41.400
and petitioned His Majesty

229
17:42.328 --> 17:45.208
to clear Grand Secretary Shen and his family of all charges.

230
17:52.590 --> 17:53.750
The sages taught

231
17:54.360 --> 17:56.376
that a son should not speak of his father's faults.

232
17:57.240 --> 17:59.680
Besides, during his reign,

233
17:59.704 --> 18:02.088
the founding Emperor was diligent and incorruptible

234
18:02.568 --> 18:04.376
and was considered a wise ruler.

235
18:06.790 --> 18:08.920
That memorial won't be approved.

236
18:10.830 --> 18:12.110
His Majesty didn't approve it.

237
18:13.480 --> 18:14.310
However,

238
18:15.070 --> 18:16.720
after receiving the memorial,

239
18:17.590 --> 18:20.160
he released all the other officials

240
18:20.264 --> 18:22.056
who were being held in the imperial prison.

241
18:28.030 --> 18:29.480
Scholar Shouyi

242
18:29.800 --> 18:31.656
saved them by drawing attention elsewhere.

243
18:32.720 --> 18:34.110
He made those eunuchs

244
18:34.400 --> 18:35.680
wary of going too far.

245
18:36.200 --> 18:37.240
It's good to remind them

246
18:37.240 --> 18:39.160
that integrity still lives on

247
18:39.790 --> 18:40.960
in the written word.

248
18:49.800 --> 18:51.510
Petty disputes can spiral out of control,

249
18:52.472 --> 18:54.310
just as an anthill can bring down a dike.

250
19:01.720 --> 19:02.680
From now on,

251
19:05.350 --> 19:07.510
I'll stay by your side with the children

252
19:08.400 --> 19:09.790
and live a peaceful life.

253
19:16.640 --> 19:17.310
All right.

254
19:55.920 --> 19:56.550
Stop.

255
19:58.400 --> 19:59.270
Straighten your back.

256
20:02.880 --> 20:03.920
Look straight ahead.

257
20:05.400 --> 20:06.400
Raise your hand higher.

258
20:07.400 --> 20:09.240
Do you remember this move?

259
20:09.680 --> 20:10.510
I do.

260
20:20.030 --> 20:20.680
I'm not tired.

261
20:21.310 --> 20:22.440
Father, I'm not hot.

262
20:24.510 --> 20:25.160
Downward strike.

263
20:25.928 --> 20:26.790
Horizontal sweep.

264
20:27.160 --> 20:28.030
Turn and thrust.

265
20:28.344 --> 20:30.030
Do you remember what I just taught you?

266
20:30.400 --> 20:31.110
I do.

267
20:31.160 --> 20:31.720
Come on.

268
20:46.460 --> 20:49.060
(Lin Zhangcheng, 16 years old)

269
21:07.000 --> 21:07.510
Good.

270
21:07.928 --> 21:10.030
You're every bit as good as I was at your age.

271
21:12.488 --> 21:14.000
Father, you're flattering me again.

272
21:17.480 --> 21:18.270
In this world,

273
21:18.776 --> 21:20.110
apart from a very small number

274
21:20.110 --> 21:21.720
of exceptionally gifted women,

275
21:22.270 --> 21:24.070
most women are naturally

276
21:24.310 --> 21:25.880
not as strong as men.

277
21:26.440 --> 21:27.440
If you can avoid a fight,

278
21:28.110 --> 21:29.110
then don't fight.

279
21:31.048 --> 21:32.904
The best strategy is to outthink your enemy.

280
21:32.936 --> 21:34.808
The next best is to win through diplomacy.

281
21:34.820 --> 21:36.552
Only after that should you resort to force.

282
21:37.640 --> 21:38.720
Winning without bloodshed

283
21:39.440 --> 21:40.590
is the best course.

284
21:43.720 --> 21:44.270
So,

285
21:44.590 --> 21:45.750
Father, you mean

286
21:45.880 --> 21:47.200
I should learn more from Mother?

287
21:51.200 --> 21:52.720
I may be clever,

288
21:54.400 --> 21:55.350
but your mother

289
21:56.070 --> 21:57.240
is truly wise.

290
21:58.720 --> 22:00.440
Of course you should learn more from her.

291
22:02.110 --> 22:03.070
I'll remember that.

292
22:09.350 --> 22:10.680
But once you do have to fight

293
22:12.310 --> 22:13.270
and draw your sword,

294
22:14.440 --> 22:15.880
you must show no mercy.

295
22:16.920 --> 22:18.000
Either you die

296
22:18.960 --> 22:20.000
or I live.

297
22:31.790 --> 22:32.590
Remember,

298
22:34.830 --> 22:35.830
your parents

299
22:38.070 --> 22:39.160
want you to live.

300
22:44.720 --> 22:45.680
I'll remember that.

301
22:45.920 --> 22:47.240
I would never dare make you grieve.

302
23:17.160 --> 23:18.510
It's getting late.

303
23:19.000 --> 23:21.000
I still have to hurry to the Matchmaker Temple

304
23:21.110 --> 23:22.270
to offer incense.

305
23:28.216 --> 23:29.240
The Matchmaker Temple?

306
23:54.040 --> 23:55.030
Why are you still awake?

307
24:00.720 --> 24:01.270
Come.

308
24:02.520 --> 24:04.310
Sit with me for a while before we sleep.

309
24:30.400 --> 24:31.550
Zhangcheng said

310
24:32.640 --> 24:34.350
you went to the Matchmaker Temple today.

311
24:35.576 --> 24:37.528
Were you praying for our son to find a match?

312
24:39.680 --> 24:41.720
Zhangrun is only thirteen.

313
24:42.830 --> 24:44.920
Isn't it a little early to worry about that?

314
24:49.550 --> 24:50.550
I

315
24:54.240 --> 24:56.680
was praying for a match for myself.

316
24:58.920 --> 25:00.240
In our next life,

317
25:02.310 --> 25:04.790
I want us to be husband and wife again.

318
25:12.440 --> 25:14.640
The Matchmaker God has already granted my wish.

319
25:58.510 --> 26:02.200
If I'd known I would marry you,

320
26:04.220 --> 26:05.960
I would've taken better care of myself

321
26:09.310 --> 26:11.640
back in Jinzhou.

322
26:24.200 --> 26:25.400
They say

323
26:27.920 --> 26:29.830
when no debts remain in this life,

324
26:30.920 --> 26:32.400
there will be no meeting in the next.

325
26:37.550 --> 26:39.920
I've thought about it carefully for a long time.

326
26:44.680 --> 26:47.110
I owe you so much in this life.

327
26:57.680 --> 26:58.960
So in our next life,

328
27:01.750 --> 27:04.480
you must come find me and make me repay you.

329
27:12.480 --> 27:14.510
If you don't come find me,

330
27:18.920 --> 27:21.350
I'll follow this red thread

331
27:22.270 --> 27:23.790
until I find you.

332
27:24.770 --> 27:27.110
No matter how fate entangles us,

333
27:28.350 --> 27:29.920
in the end,

334
27:34.310 --> 27:36.270
we're meant to be husband and wife.

335
27:49.000 --> 27:50.000
One lifetime

336
27:51.070 --> 27:52.030
is enough.

337
28:01.200 --> 28:03.640
We were brought together by fate.

338
28:16.030 --> 28:17.270
How could you

339
28:18.680 --> 28:20.310
not give yourself to save me?

340
28:27.160 --> 28:29.030
You're such a fool.

341
28:40.680 --> 28:42.980
♪Look at us♪

342
28:43.920 --> 28:46.340
♪We've shared countless beautiful moments♪

343
28:46.350 --> 28:48.750
I've already made a deal with the Matchmaker God.

344
28:50.830 --> 28:53.400
When I became engaged to my wife,

345
28:55.720 --> 28:57.590
her name was Shen Jialan.

346
29:01.030 --> 29:03.030
When I married her,

347
29:06.270 --> 29:08.080
her name was Xu Lanxiang.

348
29:08.080 --> 29:10.800
♪There will always be someone to share it with♪

349
29:12.000 --> 29:14.110
The red thread

350
29:16.720 --> 29:19.400
has always bound me to the same person.

351
29:21.500 --> 29:25.260
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

352
29:27.240 --> 29:28.400
Please...

353
29:29.750 --> 29:30.920
Please...

354
29:33.400 --> 29:34.730
Please...

355
29:34.730 --> 29:37.630
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

356
29:38.110 --> 29:41.110
don't get it wrong...

357
29:41.590 --> 29:44.440
♪Our bond runs deep♪

358
29:45.270 --> 29:48.360
♪Binding us closely together♪

359
29:48.900 --> 29:51.550
♪After all the questions life has brought♪

360
29:51.840 --> 29:56.000
♪This love has never faded in the slightest♪

361
29:56.860 --> 30:00.310
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

362
30:01.220 --> 30:04.300
♪How fortunate to find one person in a lifetime♪

363
30:04.940 --> 30:06.500
♪Through the warm passing years♪

364
30:07.120 --> 30:12.960
♪My heart remains as true to you as ever♪

365
30:40.680 --> 30:42.980
♪Look at us♪

366
30:43.920 --> 30:48.030
♪We've shared countless beautiful moments♪

367
30:49.710 --> 30:54.720
♪Through life's winding road, we've weathered countless trials♪

368
30:56.710 --> 31:03.440
♪I'm blessed to spend each peaceful day and night with you♪

369
31:04.880 --> 31:07.520
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

370
31:08.130 --> 31:10.870
♪There will always be someone to share it with♪

371
31:11.080 --> 31:14.200
♪Our bond runs deep♪

372
31:14.680 --> 31:17.980
♪Binding us closely together♪

373
31:18.460 --> 31:21.180
♪After all the questions life has brought♪

374
31:21.350 --> 31:25.630
♪This love has never faded in the slightest♪

375
31:26.400 --> 31:29.830
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

376
31:30.660 --> 31:33.990
♪How fortunate to find one person in a lifetime♪

377
31:34.420 --> 31:36.330
♪Through the warm passing years♪

378
31:36.580 --> 31:42.400
♪My heart remains as true to you as ever♪

379
32:18.550 --> 32:24.160
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

380
32:24.700 --> 32:29.640
♪Flowers bloom in turn as twilight falls♪

381
32:30.830 --> 32:36.230
♪Through rise and fall, people meet and part as they always do♪

382
32:36.850 --> 32:42.510
♪Each plant endures its own trials before reaching shore♪

383
32:42.920 --> 32:45.780
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

384
32:46.040 --> 32:49.100
♪Plum blossoms bloom, enduring the frost♪

385
32:49.470 --> 32:54.860
♪Yet their proud spirit fades with wind and snow♪

386
32:55.070 --> 32:58.070
♪Bamboo shadows embrace quiet contentment♪

387
32:58.230 --> 33:01.170
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

388
33:01.580 --> 33:07.110
♪Watching the old and new take turns in this world♪

389
33:07.110 --> 33:12.680
♪Spring comes, and I smile upon a garden in full bloom♪

390
33:15.400 --> 33:16.310
Life is short.

391
33:16.590 --> 33:18.270
We should do what we love most

392
33:18.590 --> 33:20.000
to make this life worth living.

393
33:20.590 --> 33:23.440
I can write, keep accounts, and run a business.

394
33:23.720 --> 33:25.680
Someday, I can be a shopkeeper myself.

395
33:26.350 --> 33:27.310
I'm the eldest sister.

396
33:27.320 --> 33:29.160
If anyone is to lead the way, it should be me.

397
33:29.960 --> 33:31.440
I want to start over

398
33:31.550 --> 33:33.096
and live a better life than before.

399
33:33.400 --> 33:34.440
I hope

400
33:34.790 --> 33:36.440
you can all live better lives too.

401
33:37.510 --> 33:38.200
We

402
33:38.200 --> 33:39.920
should always hope

403
33:39.920 --> 33:41.736
that each year will be better than the last.

404
33:41.790 --> 33:44.030
I learned to read and began studying.

405
33:44.120 --> 33:45.750
The road ahead grew wider and brighter.

406
33:46.110 --> 33:47.510
I will learn to ride a horse,

407
33:47.510 --> 33:48.590
travel far and wide,

408
33:49.030 --> 33:50.550
and see all the wonders of the land.

409
33:51.790 --> 33:53.720
I don't want to live in fear anymore.

410
33:54.350 --> 33:56.270
I want to live a life of wealth and privilege.

411
33:56.510 --> 33:58.640
As long as my brother is safe

412
33:58.720 --> 34:00.070
and Mother is happy,

413
34:00.270 --> 34:01.750
I'll have everything I need.

414
34:01.860 --> 34:07.780
♪Each plant endures its own trials before reaching shore♪

415
34:08.050 --> 34:10.790
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

416
34:11.080 --> 34:14.080
♪Plum blossoms bloom, enduring the frost♪

417
34:14.360 --> 34:19.900
♪Yet their proud spirit fades with wind and snow♪

418
34:21.800 --> 34:22.760
Great-Grandmother.

419
34:23.250 --> 34:26.290
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

420
34:26.610 --> 34:30.580
♪Watching the old and new take turns in this world♪

421
34:30.580 --> 34:34.660
(Many Years Later)

422
34:37.464 --> 34:39.128
(Lin Zhihuan, 20 years old) Great-Grandmother, why are you

423
34:39.160 --> 34:41.608
(Lanxiang's granddaughter) here alone? Where are the maids?

424
34:42.030 --> 34:44.190
I wanted some time alone,

425
34:44.480 --> 34:46.400
so I sent them away.

426
34:48.480 --> 34:49.510
Let's go back.

427
35:02.880 --> 35:03.630
Take your time.

428
35:25.960 --> 35:26.670
Great-Grandmother,

429
35:27.590 --> 35:29.230
I've seen all the other plays.

430
35:29.840 --> 35:30.840
Why

431
35:31.510 --> 35:33.150
is every woman in these plays

432
35:33.760 --> 35:35.110
named Tanniang?

433
35:39.480 --> 35:44.360
"Tan" comes from the udumbara flower.

434
35:46.360 --> 35:48.360
The wondrous Dharma

435
35:49.000 --> 35:51.480
is like the udumbara flower,

436
35:52.030 --> 35:54.440
which appears only once in a great while.

437
36:01.190 --> 36:02.800
There is a deeper meaning in the play.

438
36:02.824 --> 36:04.710
The listener must discover it for themselves.

439
36:08.710 --> 36:09.960
"Tan"

440
36:10.760 --> 36:13.480
also evokes something fleeting like the udumbara flower.

441
36:15.320 --> 36:16.190
In this world,

442
36:16.360 --> 36:18.590
how many women can soar away like an eagle

443
36:18.590 --> 36:20.070
or become a female general?

444
36:20.550 --> 36:22.480
For most women,

445
36:23.070 --> 36:25.230
such things truly are like a beautiful dream,

446
36:25.670 --> 36:27.190
as fleeting as the udumbara flower.

447
36:31.070 --> 36:33.400
The udumbara flower is rarely seen,

448
36:34.000 --> 36:34.630
but that

449
36:35.360 --> 36:37.630
doesn't mean it doesn't exist.

450
36:45.800 --> 36:47.030
Go on now.

451
36:56.300 --> 37:01.140
(Shen Lan, the youngest daughter, brings honor to the Shen family.)

452
37:01.140 --> 37:05.752
(Cui Mei to her daughter and niece. Daughters of the Shen family)

453
37:05.752 --> 37:09.580
(must be educated and well-mannered)

454
37:18.840 --> 37:20.030
(All these years,)

455
37:21.230 --> 37:24.150
(I've written play after play,)

456
37:26.440 --> 37:29.150
(telling every joy and sorrow in women's lives.)

457
37:32.070 --> 37:33.150
(But in truth,)

458
37:34.800 --> 37:37.320
(when I first resolved to write plays,)

459
37:39.480 --> 37:42.110
(I only wanted to tell the story of the Shen family.)

460
37:42.110 --> 37:43.420
(Remember the present...)

461
37:44.110 --> 37:45.280
(I wanted to write down)

462
37:45.760 --> 37:48.280
(those warm days I remembered)

463
37:50.190 --> 37:51.800
(so I would never forget them.)

464
37:51.800 --> 37:54.660
(Never forget...)

465
37:54.670 --> 37:55.360
(Later,)

466
37:56.110 --> 37:57.960
(I became driven by a greater purpose.)

467
37:57.960 --> 38:01.260
(Never forget the past.)

468
38:01.280 --> 38:03.760
(I wanted more than for the Shen family to be remembered.)

469
38:05.110 --> 38:06.760
(I also wanted to clear the names)

470
38:07.400 --> 38:08.440
(of my grandfather,)

471
38:09.670 --> 38:10.590
(my grandmother,)

472
38:11.320 --> 38:12.360
(my father,)

473
38:13.510 --> 38:15.030
(and my mother.)

474
38:15.030 --> 38:20.420
(Walk this life once...)

475
38:20.760 --> 38:22.230
(The ruler guides his subjects.)

476
38:23.590 --> 38:24.880
(As subjects of the realm,)

477
38:25.840 --> 38:27.150
(whether we live or die,)

478
38:27.670 --> 38:29.230
(we can only endure.)

479
38:29.230 --> 38:31.230
(Only fools live in ignorance...)

480
38:31.230 --> 38:33.440
(But no matter how high an emperor sits,)

481
38:34.630 --> 38:36.190
(he still eats the grain of the land,)

482
38:37.048 --> 38:38.880
(wears clothes woven from mulberry and hemp,)

483
38:41.230 --> 38:43.070
(and is sustained by the people.)

484
38:47.760 --> 38:49.030
(As long as my plays)

485
38:49.800 --> 38:51.480
(continue to be sung among the people,)

486
38:52.536 --> 38:54.400
(the injustice suffered by the Shen family)

487
38:55.030 --> 38:56.630
(will be remembered.)

488
38:57.660 --> 38:59.660
(The Shen Family Chronicle)

489
38:59.670 --> 39:01.190
(The glow of fireflies and stars)

490
39:02.670 --> 39:03.550
(can also)

491
39:04.360 --> 39:06.880
(reveal that justice ultimately prevails.)

492
40:24.640 --> 40:27.540
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

493
40:28.790 --> 40:31.740
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

494
40:32.860 --> 40:36.500
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

495
40:37.180 --> 40:39.920
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

496
40:40.810 --> 40:44.050
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

497
40:45.200 --> 40:48.260
♪And the worries etched between our brows♪

498
40:49.420 --> 40:53.410
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

499
40:53.700 --> 40:56.800
♪While two pairs of eyes watch from below♪

500
40:59.050 --> 41:02.900
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

501
41:02.900 --> 41:06.540
(The Shen Family Chronicle)

502
41:06.980 --> 41:09.180
(One hundred and thirteen years later,)

503
41:09.650 --> 41:14.390
(after repeated petitions initiated by the people,)

504
41:14.980 --> 41:18.020
(the Emperor cleared Shen Qihan and his sons of all charges,)

505
41:18.136 --> 41:20.120
(granted him the posthumous title Wenqing,)

506
41:20.248 --> 41:23.220
(honored the women of the Shen family for their virtue and fortitude,)

507
41:23.448 --> 41:25.830
(returned their remains to their ancestral home for burial,)

508
41:26.190 --> 41:28.220
(and had a tomb and memorial shrine built.)

509
41:28.900 --> 41:33.170
♪People gather, then part♪

510
41:34.580 --> 41:37.830
♪Regret is a letter wishing you well♪

511
41:39.030 --> 41:42.040
♪Yet a figure hobbles away♪

512
41:43.350 --> 41:47.450
♪Back home, leaves fall upon the blue-tiled roofs♪

513
41:47.450 --> 41:51.260
♪Leaving only a little house behind♪

514
41:51.740 --> 41:55.820
(Upholding the Virtue of Generations Past)

515
42:01.460 --> 42:03.140
(Bringing honor to the family name)

516
42:05.490 --> 42:09.280
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

517
42:09.780 --> 42:13.410
♪Snow hangs thick upon the eaves♪

518
42:13.950 --> 42:18.420
♪Four seasons wax and wane, year after year♪

519
42:18.420 --> 42:21.440
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

520
42:22.340 --> 42:25.930
♪This side of the river is also a shore♪

521
42:26.340 --> 42:30.090
♪From this side of the mountain, I miss you deeply♪

522
42:30.460 --> 42:34.980
♪Sweeping away the grass before the door in April♪

523
42:35.380 --> 42:41.820
(Peace)

524
42:42.750 --> 42:46.380
♪The evening breeze blows past distant hills♪

525
42:47.330 --> 42:50.480
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

526
42:50.940 --> 42:55.288
(Love given returns as love, and blessings bestowed return as blessings.)

527
42:55.290 --> 43:00.340
(Jia Yi, New Writings: Spring and Autumn, Han Dynasty)

528
43:00.820 --> 43:04.900
(The End)

529
43:20.140 --> 43:24.260
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

530
43:27.100 --> 43:31.620
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

531
43:32.900 --> 43:36.820
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

532
43:37.500 --> 43:40.260
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

533
43:40.980 --> 43:43.300
♪Though all the world may fade♪

534
43:43.300 --> 43:46.380
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

535
43:47.900 --> 43:52.140
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

536
43:55.060 --> 43:59.220
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

537
44:01.020 --> 44:04.580
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

538
44:04.580 --> 44:08.140
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

539
44:08.940 --> 44:14.620
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

540
44:14.980 --> 44:19.300
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

541
44:19.660 --> 44:22.620
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

542
44:22.620 --> 44:26.380
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

543
44:26.380 --> 44:29.260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

544
44:29.260 --> 44:33.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

545
44:33.340 --> 44:36.700
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

546
44:36.700 --> 44:40.460
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

547
44:40.460 --> 44:44.460
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

548
